        "content": "{\"text\": \"原始消息元数据：{\\\"channel_id\\\": \\\"ch_comp_intel\\\", \\\"user_id\\\": \\\"U_STRATEGY\\\", \\\"ts\\\": \\\"2026-01-27T07:30:00Z\\\"}\\nTeam - updated competitive intel policy for CMPBRF-502-Q1: 1. Only alert on launches from DIRECT competitors (competitor_tier=direct). Adjacent and aspirational competitors do NOT trigger full alerts. 2. RUMORED launches (status=rumored): post to #product-team ONLY with [RUMORED] prefix in the message. Do NOT send rumored launches to #sales-team. 3. CONFIRMED launches (status=confirmed): post to BOTH #product-team and #sales-team with full details including pricing. 4. Retracted and embargoed items: skip entirely, do not post. 5. Include batch ref CMPBRF-502-Q1 in every message. 6. past week means Jan 20-27 inclusive. Only Product Launch type items. The old Q4 protocol saying to alert on all tiers is SUPERSEDED.\"}"
